{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23748","headline":"送河南尹冯学士赴任 · 白居易","name":"送河南尹冯学士赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石渠金谷中间路，轩骑翩翩十日程。\n清洛饮冰添苦节，碧嵩看雪助高情。\n谩夸河北操旄钺，莫羡江西拥斾旌。\n何似府寮京令外，别教三十六峰迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}